OL,3,GNEWSABody found during search for
OL,4,Amissing woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have been granted additional
OL,7,Ftime to question two people who had
OL,8,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of murder in
OL,9,Fthe Enniskillen area on Sunday.
